# An LED blinking: a square wave, once a second, through a resistor.
#
# While the source is at 5 V the LED takes about 1.9 V and the resistor the rest; while it is at 0 V
# nothing flows and the LED is dark.

speed 1

source    V1  0 0  0 6  square 0 5 1
resistor  R1  0 0  6 0  220
led       D1  6 0  6 6  green
wire          6 6  0 6
ground        0 6
meter     M1  6 0  6 6
